{"id":"reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"A Simple Word Game Became a Huge Global Hit","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wordle"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Josh Wardle made a simple word game on the internet.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.58,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.71,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.9,1.24,1.42,1.78,2.16,2.42,2.78,2.9]},{"text":"He made this fun game for his partner Palak Shah.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.2,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.48,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.2,0.46,0.76,1.08,1.42,1.56,1.84,2.54]},{"text":"Every day players guess one secret word in six tries.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t1-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.05,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":5.01,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.44,0.9,1.22,1.62,2.1,2.58,2.9,3.18]},{"text":"People shared their game results with friends online in 2021.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.03,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.99,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.48,0.8,1.02,1.36,1.66,1.94,2.3,2.84]},{"text":"A big newspaper company bought the game in early 2022.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.17,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":4.82,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.52,1.22,1.58,1.84,2.04,2.32,2.64]}],"bands":{"core1000":87,"core1800":7,"ngsl":0,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":4},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"made","title":"Simple Past Tense","note":"We use the simple past tense to talk about finished actions in the past. Here, 'made' shows that Josh created the game at a specific point in time."},{"i":2,"focus":"guess","title":"Simple Present Tense for Routines","note":"The simple present tense is used for actions that happen regularly or repeatedly. In this sentence, 'guess' describes the daily routine of players."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Josh Wardle created a game on a website for his partner.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.96,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":4.63,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.88,1.34,1.62,1.88,2.16,2.26,2.6,3.06,3.2]},{"text":"Players try to find a secret word of five letters every day.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.27,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.28,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.62,0.82,1.06,1.3,1.64,2.12,2.4,2.76,3.12,3.76]},{"text":"Colors show players if letters are in the right places.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.23,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.05,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.6,0.9,1.28,1.52,1.9,2.06,2.16,2.34]},{"text":"Many people shared their daily scores online, so the game grew.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","S","S","V"],"dur":4.25,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.28,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.6,0.9,1.3,1.46,1.96,3.08,3.22,3.36,3.52]},{"text":"Over two million people played the web game by January 2022.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.51,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":5.51,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.52,0.88,1.36,1.76,1.98,2.12,2.4,2.7,3.06]},{"text":"The New York Times Company bought the game because it became famous.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","C"],"dur":4.3,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":4.89,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.44,0.74,1.24,1.56,1.82,2.08,2.64,2.78,3.1]}],"bands":{"core1000":83,"core1800":7,"ngsl":3,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"players if letters are in the right places","title":"Indirect and Direct Objects","note":"The verb 'show' takes two objects in this sentence. 'Players' is the indirect object, while the 'if' clause acts as the direct object telling what is shown."},{"i":3,"focus":"so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction 'so'","note":"The word 'so' connects two full clauses to show a cause-and-effect relationship. It explains that people sharing scores caused the game to grow."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Software engineer Josh Wardle, a person who writes computer code, built the game Wordle.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":6.47,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.7,"times":[0.0,0.48,1.06,1.64,2.56,2.64,2.98,3.2,3.46,3.78,4.8,5.06,5.32,5.54]},{"text":"He designed the online game on a website for his partner, Palak Shah.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.43,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.17,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.68,0.88,1.36,1.66,1.76,2.08,2.5,2.64,3.52,3.78]},{"text":"Players get six attempts to guess a hidden word of five letters daily.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M"],"dur":4.56,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.14,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.48,0.86,1.32,1.76,1.94,2.24,2.44,2.86,3.1,3.42,3.8]},{"text":"Colored boxes show whether guessed letters are in the correct place.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.78,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.12,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.56,1.08,1.36,1.66,2.08,2.46,2.6,2.72,2.96]},{"text":"Millions of people shared their daily scores online, helping the game grow quickly.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.07,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.67,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.56,0.86,1.2,1.58,1.78,2.22,3.32,3.56,3.8,4.0,4.36]},{"text":"The user base has expanded fast, reaching millions of active players within months.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.08,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.32,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.28,0.58,0.84,1.28,2.28,2.58,2.9,3.3,3.5,4.08,4.36]},{"text":"The New York Times Company bought the popular game in January 2022.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.9,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":5.92,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.44,0.72,1.2,1.5,1.78,2.02,2.46,2.68,3.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":80,"core1800":14,"ngsl":1,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":4,"focus":"helping the game grow quickly","title":"Participle Clauses for Result","note":"An '-ing' participle phrase at the end of a clause can express a natural result. Here, it shows how the action of sharing scores directly led to rapid growth."},{"i":5,"focus":"has expanded","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect connects a past event to the present moment. It highlights that the expansion started in the past and has continuing relevance."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Software engineer Josh Wardle initially developed Wordle as a private digital game for his partner.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","M","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":7.85,"times":[0.0,0.38,1.18,1.66,2.28,2.78,3.36,3.98,4.28,4.4,4.78,5.28,5.7,6.06,6.2]},{"text":"The game was made available to the public in October 2021 after positive feedback from family.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.38,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.57,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,0.44,0.64,0.98,1.3,1.38,1.66,2.08,2.52,3.54,4.38,4.9,5.22,5.7]},{"text":"Players are given six attempts to guess a secret word of five letters using colored tiles for guidance.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.68,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.77,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.4,0.52,0.94,1.36,1.76,1.88,2.14,2.46,2.9,3.18,3.52,4.0,4.64,5.08,5.5,5.96]},{"text":"Game results were frequently shared on social media after a visual score feature was introduced.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V"],"dur":5.74,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":5.82,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.46,0.8,1.06,1.64,1.9,2.18,2.62,3.3,3.5,3.8,4.2,4.68,4.92]},{"text":"The platform experienced massive growth, expanding from ninety users to over two million in two months.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.03,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.38,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.42,0.82,1.64,2.68,2.92,3.36,3.64,4.22,4.64,4.88,5.2,5.58,6.06,6.3]},{"text":"Wardle stated that offering only one puzzle per day created a sense of scarcity for players.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":5.98,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.4,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.62,0.94,1.24,1.78,2.08,2.48,2.78,3.06,3.76,4.1,4.3,4.54,4.86,5.38]},{"text":"In January 2022, The New York Times Company acquired the viral game for a low seven-figure sum.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.28,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.37,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.42,1.34,2.1,2.24,2.52,2.8,3.28,3.78,4.06,4.3,4.76,5.16,5.36,5.59,6.34]}],"bands":{"core1000":71,"core1800":9,"ngsl":5,"tsl":5,"nawl":0,"beyond":10},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was made available","title":"Passive Voice with Complement","note":"The passive form 'was made' shifts attention to 'the game' rather than the creator. The adjective 'available' serves as a subject complement describing the game's state."},{"i":5,"focus":"offering only one puzzle per day","title":"Gerund Phrase as Subject","note":"A gerund phrase begins with an '-ing' verb and functions as a noun. In this sub-clause, the entire phrase acts as the subject that 'created' scarcity."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"What began as an intimate digital gift from Welsh software engineer Josh Wardle to his partner rapidly transformed into a global gaming phenomenon.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t5-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.24,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":11.71,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.48,1.02,1.16,1.52,2.1,2.52,2.96,3.2,3.64,4.32,4.8,5.34,5.62,5.74,6.12,7.0,7.7,8.3,8.44,8.76,9.2]},{"text":"Wardle created an early prototype in 2013, but he revived and refined the minimalist word puzzle during the pandemic.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":8.28,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.38,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.76,1.04,1.36,1.7,2.26,3.64,3.82,3.98,4.32,4.82,5.2,5.64,6.0,6.48,6.84,7.3,7.52]},{"text":"The rules are straightforward, allowing players six attempts to deduce a secret five-letter word using color-coded feedback.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.03,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":9.17,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.62,1.86,2.08,2.58,2.98,3.4,3.8,4.24,4.38,4.78,5.46,5.86,6.32,7.24]},{"text":"Viral growth accelerated in late 2021 after Wardle introduced a shareable emoji format for posting results on social media.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":9.64,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.66,1.24,1.88,2.04,2.98,3.8,4.06,4.8,5.02,5.56,5.78,6.5,6.82,7.08,7.52,7.9,8.14]},{"text":"The audience expanded exponentially, surging from ninety active players in November 2021 to over two million within weeks.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.99,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-a-simple-word-game/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":9.62,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.46,0.98,2.9,2.96,3.26,3.58,4.14,4.52,4.88,5.1,6.08,6.8,6.98,7.36,7.8,8.24]},{"text":"To maintain player engagement, the game restricts users to